# MC-X-F12 control (writer 9): L §4.3 rule 2, "an input whose rows all govern `always` ... is read without one,
# by a def as by a move". base governs always: r needs no at, q = 400.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model f12b
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "MC-X-F12 control: the same with an input whose row governs always (L 4.3 rule 2: read without a law date)."

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

source act "the act"


input base: money PLN

def r[m in months]: money PLN = base

ask q: r[2027-05]

version v_act
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  base = 400.00 PLN "the base"
=== expect
q: 400.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
